{
  "uid": "swc-overview",
  "title": "swcollect · Network overview",
  "description": "Devices and their state as SolarWinds reports them. Times in tables are exactly as received from SolarWinds (server-local). Graphs place each point at the received time minus the server UTC offset measured by swcollect (sw_meta.instance.utc_offset_minutes).",
